      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu matuku a Ahashawelosha (Ahashawelosha eu nguakakokesha bantu ku Inde tô ne ku Atiopa ba mu nseke lukama ne makumi abidi ne muanda mutekete), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu matuku au mene hakashikama Ahashawelosha mu nkuasa wa bukelenge buandi wakadi mu nsubu wandi wa mu Shushana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu tshidimu tshisatu tshia bukokeshi buandi yeye wakalambishila bantu bandi banene ne bena mudimu bandi bidia bia disanka; bena bukole ba Bena Pelasa ne Bena Madai, bantu banene ne bana ba bakelenge ba mu nseke yonso, bakadi ku mpala kuandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye wakabalesha bubanji bua butumbi, ne bu mudiye ne buneme mu bukelenge, matuku a bungi bu lukama ne makumi muanda mukulu mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakahita matuku â, mukelenge wakalambishila bantu bonso bakadi nʼandi mu nsubu wandi wa mu Shushana, ne banene ne bakese, bidia bia disanka, mu tshiendedi tshia mu tshibunda tshia ku mbalasa wa mukelenge matuku muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalembelesha bilulu bitoke ne bia mai a matamba ne bia bleu bilamakasha ne mionshi ya lin mikunzubile ku nkanu ya argent, misuika ku makunshi a mabue a marbre;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.6:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Marbre adi mabue makole matoke tô.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " matanda akadi a or ne a argent mateke ha tshiendedi tshia mabue a marbre makunze ne matoke ne makunzubile ne mafike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakabanuisha nvinyo mu makoho a or (dikoho ha buadi dikoho ha buadi), bakadi ne nvinyo ya bukelenge ya bungi bu muakadi bubanji bua mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanua nvinyo bu muakadi mukenji; kawakadi wa ku bukole, bualu bua mukelenge wakadianjila kuelela bakadi ku mutu kua nsubu wandi mukenji bua kuenzabo bu muakadi disua dia muntu ne muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washeti, mukelenge mukashi, wakalambishila bakashi bakadi nʼandi mu nsubu wa bukelenge wakadi wa mukelenge Ahashawelosha bidia bia disanka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku dia muanda mutekete hakadi mutshima wa mukelenge musanke ne nvinyo yeye wakatuma mukenji kudi Mehumana ne Bizeta ne Hâbona ne Bigata ne Abagata ne Zetâ ne Kakasa, bantu batungula muanda mutekete bakadi benza mudimu ku mesu kua mukelenge Ahashawelosha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua kuluabo ne Washeti, mukelenge mukashi, ku mpala kua mukelenge muluate tshifulu tshia bukelenge bua kulesheye bantu ne bantu banene bulengele buandi; bualu bua yeye wakadi muimpe kumona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Washeti, mukelenge mukashi, wakabenga kulua ku mukenji wa mukelenge wakatumeye kudi bantu batungula; nunku mukelenge wakadi ne tshiji tshikole, ne tshiji tshiandi tshiakatema munda muandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge wakabikila bena meji bakamanya bikondo, bualu bua mukelenge wakadi ne tshilele nunku kudi bamanyi ba mikenji ne dilumbulula: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kâshena ne Sheta ne Ademata ne Tâshishi ne Melese ne Mâsena ne Memukana, bantu aba banene muanda mutekete ba mu Pelasa ne Madai, bakadi batangila mpala wa mukelenge, ne bakadi bashikama mu muaba wa ku mpala mu bukelenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakabakonka ne, Netuenzele mukelenge mukashi Washeti tshinyi bualu bua yeye wakabenga kuenza mukenji wa mukelenge Ahashawelosha wakatumeye kudi bantu batungula? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Memukana wakitaba ku mesu kua mukelenge ne bantu banene ne, Washeti, mukelenge mukashi, kakenzela anu mukelenge nkayandi bibi kadi wakenzela bantu banene bonso ne bantu bonso ba mu nseke yonso ya mukelenge Ahashawelosha bibi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bualu ebu buakenza mukelenge mukashi nebufike kudi bakashi bonso, nebufuishe balume babo bundu ku mesu kuabo hamanyabo ne, Mukelenge Ahashawelosha wakatumina Washeti, mukelenge mukashi, mukenji bua kulueye ku mesu kuandi, kadi yeye kakalua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku edi bakashi ba bantu banene ba mu Pelasa ne Madai bakunvua bualu buakenza mukelenge mukashi nebambile bantu banene ba mukelenge muomumue. Nunku nebikale ne bundu ne tshiji bia bungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku biasua mukelenge kuela mukenji wandi, baufunde mu mikenji ya Bena Pelasa ne Bena Madai idibo kabayi bamanye mua kukudimuna ne, Washeti kalu ku mesu kua mukelenge Ahashawelosha kabidi tshiendelele; mukelenge afile muaba wandi wa bukelenge kudi mukuabo udi umuhita buakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, hatumabo mukenji eu wa mukelenge ku nseke ya bukelenge buandi yonso, bualu bua budi bunene, bakashi bonso, ne banene ne bakese, nebatumbishe babayabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu ebu buakasankisha mutshima wa mukelenge ne bantu banene; mukelenge Wakenza bu muakadi dî dia Memukana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bualu bua yeye wakatuma mikanda ku nseke yonso, bafundile bantu bonso mu muaku wabo ne, Mulume yonso akokeshe ba mu nsubu wandi, akule mu muaku wa bantu bandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
